    "fLayers": { "x": 2820, "y": 8520, "w": 320, "maxH": 520, "fill": "blue", "text": "F scene layers, back to front (each state swaps layers, nothing is redrawn):\n1 Sky: 4 dithered bands, plus stars at night\n2 Sun or moon: big sun with rays (clear), big sun behind clouds (mostly), sun (short night), none (cloudy, stormy), moon (night)\n3 Weather: Recovery-page clouds, storm cloud with bolt, puffs, birds, butterfly\n4 Ground + flowers: grass ramp per state; bloom (clear), some (mostly), a few (short night), closed buds (cloudy), none (stormy, night)\n5 Cottage + objects: bed = Sleep, calendar = Tomorrow, mailbox = Recaps; window lit at night\n6 KIPs: your KIP's pose from recovery, overridden by a short night; buddies' own moods\n7 Overlay: rain (stormy only), then the tap tags\nBands follow the Recovery page: Excellent = clear skies, Good = mostly clear, Fair = cloudy, Low = stormy. Tile icons are the exact WeatherStrip rects." }
